  "description": "<p>When using the user credentials feature of the verification tool, some, but not all the requests to fedora are passing the credentials correctly.  This leads to a 401 access denied failure.</p>\n\n<p>The offending request appears to be in line 206 (rdflib.parse). This needs to be handled with the requests module instead in order to pass the credentials along.</p>",
